<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PathKeeper · Information & Default Action Lab</title>
  <style>
    /* ---------- COLOR SYSTEM: Blue, Brown, Cream ---------- */
    :root {
      --cream: #fefbf7;
      --cream-soft: #f8f3ec;
      --cream-deep: #f0e9e0;
      --brown: #5d4037;
      --brown-light: #8b6b5e;
      --brown-warm: #a1887f;
      --blue: #1e3a5f;
      --blue-mid: #2c4a6e;
      --blue-soft: #e7eef7;
      --blue-pale: #d9e4f0;
      --accent: #b78b5c;
      --accent-light: #d4b08c;
      --border: #e2d9d0;
      --muted: #6b5d54;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.06);
      --shadow-lg: 0 8px 30px rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.10);
      --radius: 16px;
      --radius-sm: 10px;
      --font: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
      --success: #2e7d5e;
      --warning: #b85c2c;
      --danger: #a43f35;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--brown);
      font-family: var(--font);
      line-height: 1.7;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* ---------- TYPOGRAPHY ---------- */
    h1, h2, h3, h4 {
      color: var(--blue);
      line-height: 1.25;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: var(--creme);
      font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem);
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.2vw, 2.2rem);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 1.12rem;
      margin: 0.4rem 0;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--brown);
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .muted { color: var(--muted); }
    .small { font-size: 0.82rem; }

    a { color: var(--blue); }

    /* ---------- LAYOUT ---------- */
    .container {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
      scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .section-head {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .section-head p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 780px;
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .workspace {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(280px, 0.8fr);
      gap: 1.75rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .sticky {
      position: sticky;
      top: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* ---------- HEADER / HERO ---------- */
    header {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--cream);
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .nav {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .brand span { color: var(--accent); }

    .nav small {
      color: var(--blue-pale);
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), #152c47);
      color: var(--cream);
      padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #e8e0d8;
      max-width: 780px;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    /* ---------- BUTTONS ---------- */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.2s ease;
      font-family: var(--font);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--blue);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #c99e6e; }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      border-color: var(--blue-pale);
      color: var(--cream);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }

    .btn-dark {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--cream);
    }
    .btn-dark:hover { background: var(--blue-mid); }

    .btn-light {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--blue);
      border-color: var(--border);
    }
    .btn-light:hover { background: var(--cream-soft); }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    /* ---------- CARDS & PANELS ---------- */
    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: 0.2s ease;
    }
    .card:hover { border-color: var(--brown-warm); }

    .card h3 { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
    .card p, .card li { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.93rem; }
    .card ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; }
    .card li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }

    .number {
      color: var(--brown-light);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      color: var(--blue);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .panel h3 { margin-top: 0; }

    .dark-panel {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--cream);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .dark-panel h2 { color: var(--cream); }
    .dark-panel p, .dark-panel li { color: var(--blue-pale); }
    .dark-panel ol { padding-left: 1.3rem; }
    .dark-panel li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

    /* ---------- FORMS ---------- */
    .field { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }

    label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      color: var(--brown);
    }

    label .hint {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
    }

    input[type="text"],
    input[type="url"],
    input[type="number"],
    input[type="date"],
    select,
    textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: var(--cream-soft);
      color: var(--brown);
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      transition: 0.15s ease;
    }

    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
      outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    textarea { min-height: 90px; resize: vertical; }

    input[type="range"] {
      width: 100%;
      accent-color: var(--blue);
    }

    /* ---------- CALLOUTS ---------- */
    .callout {
      background: var(--cream-soft);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .callout p { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .quote {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      text-align: center;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    /* ---------- TABLES ---------- */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: var(--white);
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      min-width: 600px;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    th {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    td { color: var(--muted); }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }

    /* ---------- RATINGS & SCORE ---------- */
    .rating {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .rating-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .rating-head label { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; }

    .rating-value {
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--blue);
      white-space: nowrap;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .rating small {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .score-panel {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--cream);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .score-panel h3 { color: var(--cream); margin-top: 1.2rem; }
    .score-panel p { color: var(--blue-pale); }
    .score-panel ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
    .score-panel li { color: var(--blue-pale); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

    .score-number {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .meter {
      height: 9px;
      background: #2f4b6b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 0.9rem 0;
    }
    .meter-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: var(--accent);
      transition: width 0.25s ease;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      color: var(--blue);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* ---------- CHECKLIST ---------- */
    .check-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .check-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.15s ease;
    }
    .check-item:hover { border-color: var(--brown-warm); }
    .check-item input { margin-top: 0.35rem; accent-color: var(--blue); width: 1rem; height: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .check-item strong { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--brown); }
    .check-item small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 0.15rem; }

    /* ---------- SCENARIO OPTIONS ---------- */
    .option {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      margin: 0.6rem 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: var(--white);
      transition: 0.15s ease;
    }
    .option:hover { border-color: var(--brown-warm); background: var(--cream-soft); }
    .option input { margin-top: 0.35rem; accent-color: var(--blue); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .option span { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--brown); }

    /* ---------- LOG CARDS ---------- */
    .log-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
    .log-card h4 { margin: 0 0 0.3rem; }
    .log-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; }

    .empty {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px dashed var(--brown-warm);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: var(--cream-soft);
    }

    /* ---------- FEEDBACK ---------- */
    .feedback {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      background: var(--cream-soft);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 1rem;
      color: var(--brown);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    }
    .feedback:empty { display: none; }
    .feedback strong { color: var(--blue); }
    .feedback pre {
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--brown);
    }

    /* ---------- EQUATION ---------- */
    .equation {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--blue);
      margin: 0.9rem 0;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    /* ---------- LESSONS ---------- */
    .lesson {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .lesson summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--blue);
      list-style-position: inside;
      transition: 0.15s ease;
    }
    .lesson summary:hover { background: var(--cream-soft); }
    .lesson-body { padding: 0 1.3rem 1.3rem; }
    .lesson-body h4 { margin: 0.8rem 0 0.2rem; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--brown); }
    .lesson-body p, .lesson-body li { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .lesson-body ul, .lesson-body ol { padding-left: 1.3rem; margin: 0.4rem 0; }
    .lesson-body li { margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }

    /* ---------- DEFAULT ACTION COMPONENTS ---------- */
    .flow-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .flow-step {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--blue-pale);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 0.9rem 0.6rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .flow-step strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .rule-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      transition: 0.15s ease;
    }
    .rule-card:hover { border-color: var(--brown-warm); }

    .rule-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .pill-trigger { background: #fdf0e6; color: var(--warning); border: 1px solid #f5d5b8; }
    .pill-action { background: var(--blue-soft); color: var(--blue); border: 1px solid var(--blue-pale); }
    .pill-cue { background: #f0ecf7; color: #5b4b8a; border: 1px solid #d8d0e8; }

    .delete-btn {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
      transition: 0.15s ease;
    }
    .delete-btn:hover { color: var(--danger); }

    .sim-stat-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .sim-stat {
      background: var(--blue-soft);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .sim-stat .val {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--blue);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .sim-stat .label {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
    footer {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--cream);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    footer strong { color: var(--accent); }
    footer p { color: var(--blue-pale); max-width: 700px; margin: 0.4rem auto; font-size: 0.9rem; }

    /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .workspace { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .sticky { position: static; }
      .flow-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .grid-3, .grid-2, .check-grid, .sim-stat-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .nav small { text-align: left; }
      .hero { padding: 2.5rem 1rem; }
      .container { padding: 0 1rem; }
      .panel { padding: 1.2rem; }
      .flow-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media print {
      header, .hero-actions, .no-print, footer { display: none !important; }
      body, main { background: white; padding: 0; }
      .sticky { position: static; }
      .score-panel { background: white; color: black; border: 1px solid #aaa; }
      .score-panel p, .score-panel li { color: #333; }
      .section, .card, .panel, .lesson { break-inside: avoid; }
    }

    /* focus visible */
    button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ========== HEADER ========== -->
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">PATH<span>KEEPER</span></div>
      <small>Information Quality &amp; Default Action Architecture</small>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ========== HERO ========== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="eyebrow">Action Planner & Focus Systems</div>
      <h1>Filter information. Architect default actions.</h1>
      <p>
        Two systems in one: first, evaluate claims, sources, and evidence with a repeatable filtering
        process. Second, design environmental defaults that replace willpower with automatic,
        frictionless execution. Learn the theory, then use the interactive tools.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#curriculum">Explore curriculum</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#decompose">Decompose a claim</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#default-actions">Build default actions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#evaluator">Evaluate information</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="container">

    <!-- ========== SECTION 01: INFORMATION QUALITY ARCHITECTURE ========== -->
    <section class="section" id="information-quality">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>01. The architecture of information quality</h2>
        <p>
          Information quality is multidimensional. A source may be authentic but outdated,
          accurate but irrelevant, useful but incomplete, or persuasive without being well-supported.
          Only allow inputs that directly improve decision accuracy or output quality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">01</div>
          <h3>Accuracy</h3>
          <p>Does the information correspond to the underlying facts? Can the specific claim be independently checked?</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">02</div>
          <h3>Provenance</h3>
          <p>Where did the information originate? Can you trace its transformations, citations, and ownership?</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">03</div>
          <h3>Relevance</h3>
          <p>Does it answer the question you actually need to resolve, or merely discuss a neighboring topic?</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">04</div>
          <h3>Timeliness</h3>
          <p>Is the information current for this decision? Different facts have different rates of change.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">05</div>
          <h3>Completeness</h3>
          <p>Are important limitations, conditions, exceptions, denominators, and contradictory findings missing?</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="number">06</div>
          <h3>Independence</h3>
          <p>Do multiple sources provide independent evidence, or are they repeating the same original assertion?</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>Core distinction:</strong> A polished presentation is not evidence. A reputable publisher is not infallible.
        A citation is not automatically relevant support. Every important claim must be evaluated in context.
      </div>

      <div class="quote" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        “The quality of your decisions is limited by the quality of the information entering your mind.”
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ========== SECTION 02: FILTER FRAMEWORK TABLE ========== -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
